# Snowflake SPCS Native App with MCP SERVER Development

This rule applies when building Snowflake Native Apps with Snowpark Container Services (SPCS), especially those exposing MCP SERVER endpoints.

## When to Apply This Rule

Apply when the user mentions:
- "native app" + "Snowflake"
- "SPCS" or "Snowpark Container Services"
- "container services" + "Snowflake"
- "MCP server" + "Snowflake"
- Building an app to run in Snowflake
- Hosting a service (MCP server, API, web app) in Snowflake

## Reference Project

Use `/Users/mxu/native-apps-examples/mcp-server-app-v1/` as the reference implementation. Read `SPCS_NATIVE_APP_DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md` for complete details.

